msgid "Delete Logged-In User Without Deleting Files?"
msgstr "Obrisati prijavljenog korisnika bez brisanja fajlova?"

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:115
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Delete Logged-In User?"
msgstr "Obrisati prijavljenog korisnika?"

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:117
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"%1 is currently logged in, so their files cannot be deleted. Delete just the "
"account instead?<nl/><nl/>This will make %1 unable to log in again, and they "
"may experience strange behaviors until they log out."
msgstr ""
"Korisnik %1 je trenutno prijavljen, pa njegovi fajlovi ne mogu da se obrišu. "
"Obrisati samo nalog?<nl/><nl/>Tada se korisnik %1 više neće moći prijaviti, "
"a do odjavljivanja sistem može čudno da se ponaša."

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:118
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"%1 is currently logged in. Deleting the account will make them unable to log "
"in again, and they may experience strange behaviors until they log out."
msgstr ""
"Korisnik %1 je trenutno prijavljen. Brisanjem naloga više neće moći da se "
"prijavi, a do odjavljivanja sistem može čudno da se ponaša."

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:125
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action: button"
msgid "Delete %1"
msgstr "Obriši korisnika %1"

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:144
#, kde-format
msgid "Change avatar"
msgstr "Promeni avatar"

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:185
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Cannot change your own username while logged in; log out and then log in as "
"another user to change this account’s username."
msgstr ""
"Ne mogu da promenim vaše korisničko ime dok ste prijavljeni; odjavite se i "
"prijavite kao drugi korisnik da biste promenili korisničko ime ovog naloga."

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:186
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Cannot change the username of a logged-in user; wait until this user logs "
"out first."
msgstr ""
"Ne mogu da promenim korisničko ime prijavljenog korisnika; sačekajte da se "
"taj korisnik prvo odjavi."

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:214
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Cannot change the account type to Standard unless there is at least one "
"other Administrator account on the system. Without one, authentication would "
"become impossible or require the insecure use of the root password."
msgstr ""
"Ne mogu da promenim tip naloga u „standardni“ ako na sistemu ne postoji bar "
"još jedan administratorski nalog. Bez njega bi autentifikacija postala "
"nemoguća ili bi zahtevala nebezbednu upotrebu korene lozinke."

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:222
#, kde-format
msgid "Email address:"
msgstr "Adresa e‑pošte:"

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:254
#, kde-format
msgid "Delete files"
msgstr "Obriši fajlove"

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:261
#, kde-format
msgid "Keep files"
msgstr "Zadrži fajlove"

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:268
#, kde-format
msgid "Delete User…"
msgstr "Obriši korisnika…"

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:274
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Cannot delete yourself! Log out and then log in as another user to delete "
"this user account."
msgstr ""
"Ne mogu da obrišem nalog sa kojim ste prijavljeni! Odjavite se i prijavite "
"kao drugi korisnik da biste obrisali ovaj korisnički nalog."

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:286
#, kde-format
msgid "Configure Fingerprint Authentication…"
msgstr "Podesi autentifikaciju otiskom prsta…"

#: src/ui/UserDetailsPage.qml:318
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Fingerprints can be used in place of a password when unlocking the screen "
"and providing administrator permissions to applications and command-line "
"programs that request them.<nl/><nl/>Logging into the system with your "
"fingerprint is not yet supported."
msgstr ""
"Otisci prstiju mogu da se koriste umesto lozinke pri otključavanju ekrana i "
"davanju administratorskih dozvola programima, uključujući i one iz komandne "
"linije, koji ih traže.<nl/><nl/>Prijavljivanje na sistem otiskom prsta još "
"nije podržano."

